[l_english.MODULE_PLANE_WEAPON_GRDATK_1B_CARROT]
Carrot (Air)

[l_english.MODULE_PLANE_WEAPON_GRDATK_1B_CARROT_desc]
Research says that carrots are good for improving eyesight, but it doesn’t seem to be the case. I stabbed carrots into the eyes of the enemy, and their eyesight decreased significantly.

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_PLANE_WEAPON_GRDATK_1B_CARROT]
胡萝卜 (空)

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_PLANE_WEAPON_GRDATK_1B_CARROT_desc]
研究说胡萝卜有利于提高视力，但似乎不是这样的，我把胡萝卜扎到敌军的眼睛里，他们的视力就显著下降了。
